'' RUN: a property named WITHOUT 'this.' inside its own type's methods -- 'color = &hffffff' in fbc's
'' OpenGL fbgl constructor, 'size = size + 1' -- is 'this.color'. PropertyAt_ took only a member
'' expression; the bare name reached the store path and declined (TKO0994; fbc-examples repro
'' ice16). Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/implicit-this-property.bas -o tests/codegen/implicitthisproperty.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/implicitthisproperty.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/implicitthisproperty.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: FFFFFF 4
